{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"05bace262e509952626cd4d6e377092dd70bb5257ad2bf7921de56a10b0d7027","slug":"learning-route","location":"/foundations/learning-route.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"学习路线：为什么不能直接从论文第一页读起？","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队","family":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队"},"name":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队","id":"contributors-Users\\limen\\Documents\\Antigravity\\math-exhibition-independent-rerun\\competition\\learning-book\\myst-generated-uid-0"}],"keywords":["数学学术展评","初中数学","机器人避障","图论","Jupyter Book"],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"learning-route.md","url":"/nujiang-math-exhibition-book/build/learning-route-542392d719c7def83b0b5b2f426d1dd4.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"两篇正式论文写给评审，必须在很少的页数里装下许多信息。初学者若直接从第一页读到最后一页，常常会遇到三种困难：符号一下子太多、结论之间的关系不清、程序算出的数不知道该信到什么程度。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"PgtK9WvykR"}],"key":"xgnkATZ7Hz"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本书因此不照搬论文目录，而是把内容重新排成一条学习路线。先认清一句结论究竟有多强，再进入两道题；先用小例子建立直觉，再读一般公式；最后才把知识压缩成答辩语言。","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"GhmI8iFt7r"}],"key":"Yf0u2ZsHHm"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"出发前：先学会判断一句话说到了哪里","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"jqeCpZVAJQ"}],"identifier":"id","label":"出发前：先学会判断一句话说到了哪里","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"eO7aD77opl"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"下一页“结论阶梯”先解决一个贯穿全书的问题：找到好方案，为什么还不等于找到最优答案？之后的“数学工具箱”只补充本书真正会用到的距离、坐标、组合数和图论语言。“计算证据”则解释搜索、穷举、负责寻找最优值的优化器，以及可供独立复核的证书，各自能证明到哪一步。","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"GpcgAGDAKD"}],"key":"iB9tKevoOD"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这几页不用一次背完。只要能用自己的话解释“算到一个很好的方案，为什么还不等于证明它最好”，就可以进入题一；遇到符号再回来查。","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"c8gm1NVHyD"}],"key":"M3FhhwbKlR"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第一段旅程：跟机器人走出障碍阵列","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"OA7sakyJ5w"}],"identifier":"id","label":"第一段旅程：跟机器人走出障碍阵列","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"xmsFaKBXYZ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"题一开场会先把题面给定、允许的动作、静态小问与旋转小问完整说清。接着，我们把有面积的机器人缩成一个点，给三角网格中的障碍物编地址，再从第一层、第二层这些能亲手核算的情形出发。九卡路线出现以后，问题自然转向：它能不能重复，给任意层数一条统一路线？","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"k7tzhhHePv"}],"key":"Dj1f2Rh6m5"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"静态问题讲完，障碍物开始旋转。这里必须先分清“方向提前知道”和“方向未知”两个世界，随后再读两套100卡方案以及连续时间安全证书，也就是怎样用一段段时间区间的距离下界覆盖运动的每一刻。手边若有硬币和杯垫，可以随着图一起摆；Notebook 用来改参数、观察现象，不代替正式证明。","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"vthv1Ll7ZJ"}],"key":"qtYWxrd8Vt"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"完成标志：你能准确说出 ","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"aiNioa5m8D"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"1\\le C(2)\\le 9","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"