</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span>","key":"l76vYR0skU"},{"type":"text","value":" 仍然只是猜想。","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"wz1gzHIFvk"}],"key":"BsDl7yOXpO"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第二段旅程：从九个点走进图论","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"opHRR73kTn"}],"identifier":"id","label":"第二段旅程：从九个点走进图论","html_id":"id-2","implicit":true,"key":"z0qooLCY4m"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"题二先用普通语言说明：六条边已经固定，我们还可以怎样加边，最后到底要把什么量降到最小。然后才把几何图抽象成“顶点和边”，先手算一到四个三角形的最省边数。","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"C0AVYKOoUX"}],"key":"IrsL76GHfg"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"小例子过后，组合数量迅速变大。我们于是把“给定三角形目标，求最少边”反过来问成“给定边数，最多有多少三角形”，再用整数规划把每条边写成0—1开关，让优化器处理全部组合。等有限规模的阶梯看清了，Kruskal–Katona定理才登场；这个一般极值定理会说明，给定边数时为何把边集中起来能产生最多三角形。固定六边带来的额外代价，也就有了可以比较的基准。","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"PYNvdQlEun"}],"key":"LoXaOSMVPH"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"最后两章研究题面开放部分中由队伍选择的附加条件。九张编号纸片和线绳很适合贯穿这一段：每出现一个公式，都先在纸面上找出它正在数什么。","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"Nnntg1VHOX"}],"key":"JX24DcQWCe"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"