":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"综合部分会把两题放进同一张研究地图，逐条处理常见误解，再让三名队员轮换做讲解者、追问者和证据检查员。终章挑战不是考小数记忆，而是检查你能否把条件、证据和边界连成完整因果。","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"l1keMKuGjb"}],"key":"e4WTzqTpsm"},{"type":"div","class":"teacher-note","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"给带队教师","key":"q0nWDTrlAq"}],"key":"QkIoWmjfce"},{"type":"text","value":"：不要以“读了多少页”判断进度。每次训练只选一个核心句，让学生画图、举反例、换一种说法，再由同伴指出缺失条件。能指出一句话的适用边界，比背出整段证明更接近真正理解。","key":"jBKnm5OMvJ"}],"key":"C64x9DJVUq"}],"key":"w9LEWak06H"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"学习记录表","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"FNYxhrPSAO"}],"identifier":"id","label":"学习记录表","html_id":"id-4","implicit":true,"key":"VJ2iVTUyJL"},{"type":"table","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"日期","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"key":"U9qqRU4HrE"}],"key":"eu5bkivtnF"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"学到哪一章","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"key":"GGzGYSz6O4"}],"key":"YigEYZFJHg"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"我能画出的图","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"key":"yjDNd1mQKT"}],"key":"ToKDcgHm0v"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":43,